///|
/// Proof obligations for this package. See `.claude/VERIFICATION-moonbit.md`.
///
/// This is a canary, not a theorem anyone needed. It proves that the
/// verification pipeline runs end to end -- MoonBit to WhyML to an SMT solver
/// and back -- so that a future session can tell "the toolchain is wired up"
/// apart from "the toolchain silently did nothing". The properties actually
/// worth proving about this server are blocked on the verification language
/// having no strings; the assessment note explains why and what would unblock
/// them.
lemma seq_step_is_positive(seq : Int) where {
  proof_require: seq >= 0,
  proof_ensure: seq + 1 >= 1,
  proof_reasoning: "Adding one to a non-negative integer yields a positive one.",
} {}
